mission "The Gallows Tide"
    name "The Gallows Tide"
    description "Find Vane's prison flotilla south of Tortuga, sink its three guard ships, then sail to Port Royal so the freed crews can find safe harbour."
    destination "Port Royal"
    source "Tortuga"
    reward 620
    objective kills 3
    battlefield "The Gallows Tide" 1500 830
    enemy "The Gallows Tide"
    enemy "The Chainbreaker"
    enemy "The Black Shackle"
    speaker offer "Marta, the Tavern Keeper"
    speaker visit "Marta, the Tavern Keeper"
    speaker complete "Marta, the Tavern Keeper"
    to offer
        has "The Price of Silence: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The Broken Mast is crowded, but the room falls quiet when Marta climbs onto a bench. She spreads a chart across the table. Three black marks sit along the shoals south of Tortuga.`
            `"Vane's men have taken sailors from six ships. They keep them aboard the prison flotilla and force them to work the pumps and guns. The Gallows Tide is its name, though there are other vessels guarding it."`
            `"The flotilla is marked on this chart, south of Tortuga. Sink its three guard ships and the surviving prisoners can take the boats. Then sail to Port Royal. Its free captains have offered the prisoners a safe harbour."`
            choice
                `"I'll break his prison fleet."`
                    goto accept_job
                `"What if the prisoners are aboard the ships I sink?"`
                    goto details
                `"I'm not risking my crew for strangers."`
                    goto decline_job
            label details
                `Marta points to the chart. "The prison ship keeps its boats trailing astern. The guards are the ones who fight. Give them a chance to strike their colours, but do not let them regroup. The prisoners know how to swim, and we will have boats waiting."`
                choice
                    `"Then I'll give them their chance. Ready the boats."`
                        goto accept_job
                    `"It's too dangerous. I refuse."`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Marta places a black ribbon on the chart. "Fly this from your mast. Any prisoner who sees it will know help has come."`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `Marta folds the chart. "I will find another captain. I only hope there is still time."`
                close
    on accept
        log "Hunting Vane's prison flotilla. Sink three pirate ships; their prisoners will try to escape in the confusion."
    on visit
        conversation
            `You bring your ship into Port Royal. The freed sailors are already coming ashore in small boats, and Marta has travelled to Port Royal and is waiting beside the quay to hear how the prison flotilla was broken.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `A signal rocket rises from the shoals. One by one, small boats pull away from the wrecks and steer for Port Royal. The rescued sailors cheer when they see your black ribbon.`
            `Marta meets you on the quay. "You did it. Some have lost everything, but they are alive. One of them is a shipwright named Tomas. He says Vane is refitting a heavy warship in Havana, and he knows the secret route into the harbour."`
            `"Find Tomas at the quay. He will tell you what he knows."`
        log "Destroyed the prison flotilla and freed its captives. Shipwright Tomas knows a secret route into Havana."
